      "tool_uses": [],
      "assistant_text": "According to the [[credential-scoping]] article, the Anthropic API key is **injected into the environment of the spawned Ingest agent child process immediately before that process starts**. \n\nMore specifically:\n\n- A local secrets loader reads the key from a git-ignored \u0060.env\u0060 file at startup\n- It injects the key **only into the environment of the spawned child process** (the Ingest agent)\n- The Hub\u0027s own process environment is never mutated and never holds the key\n\nThe article also notes that the Query agent uses the same scoping model \u2014 it receives the credential injected into its own environment at spawn time, not inherited from or written into the Hub\u0027s process.",
